ria and Afghanistan if  Mohammed Sidique Khan visited Israel  just weeks before the bombing that took  place here and he knew the two men that  carried it out it raises the question of  whether the investigation into the  backgrounds and the network of the  Mike's place for MERS was sufficient  after Mike's place some of Charice  relatives were put on trial for  withholding information one was cleared  and two others had cases dropped no one  has ever been convicted in the UK for  connection to the tel-aviv attacks okay  let's go walk in and out of Israel for  Joshua Fordham there's always been  questions about the British response to  what happened at Mike's place he was  working as a barman when the bombing  took place who's also filming a  documentary about the bar itself I had  about 30 hours of footage that I had  collected about a week or two before  before the bombing and of course the  night of the bombing I remember I filmed  at least two hours of footage the  footage was of understandable interest  to the authorities in his recently  published graphic novel about the  attacks he recounts an interview with  Israeli intelligence before they sent me  off they said the British Secret Service  are going to be getting in contact with  you in the next few days because they  want to interview you and they want to  see your tapes please please cooperate  with them and I said to them absolutely  and basically the the end of the meeting  was basically them saying to me this is  their problem they had my details and  they said that they passed it on and I  never ever heard from them after seven  seven Israeli authorities looked into  whether Khan's visit to Israel was part  of the planning for the Mike's place  attacks they've since said there were no  findings to corroborate this but was it  really just a tourist trip analysts  speculate Khan's use of Allenby crossing  with Jordan may have been to scout the  security at the crossing itself why  because they believed 